abstract: >-
  Benchmark, scripts and results of deliverable D10.3 of the ELIXIR-funded KYBELE project
  (Knowledge Yield from BiodivΕrsity Literature through LLM Extraction): an evaluation of the
  SIBiLS biomedical and biodiversity question-answering service on 126 curated questions about
  body size, habitat and trophic guild of Collembola (springtails), drawn from Plazi taxonomic
  treatments.
